      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">85 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Trie + Strategy</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Atlassian code design</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Autocomplete, Trie &amp; Wildcard Router</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two interview problems built on one data structure. First, search autocomplete: record what people type, return the top k completions for a prefix, ranked by a pluggable Strategy (frequency, recency), with top-k cached at every trie node and kept exact on insert and delete. Second, the Atlassian \"middleware router\": register path patterns with <code>:params</code>, <code>*</code> and <code>**</code>, match a path with the right precedence and backtracking, then the follow-up where the wildcard is in the query. Running Java, Python and C++14 code, a 90-minute plan and the follow-ups.</p>\n"
  },
